OL,3,GNEWSAMan fled on van with
OL,4,Alife-threatening stab wound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man escaped on the top of a van with
OL,7,Fa life-threatening injury after being
OL,8,Fstabbed in the stomach, a court has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FThe victim was ambushed and attacked by
OL,12,FCharles Hoe, 20, and Michael Flanigan,
OL,13,F30, outside a shop in Grangetown,
OL,14,FRedcar, on 4 March, Teesside Crown
OL,15,FCourt heard.
OL,17,FThe attackers were later involved in
OL,18,Framming a stolen car into parked
OL,19,Fvehicles as masked men sought a house,
OL,20,Fthe court was told.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
