OL,3,GNEWSAMan fled on van with
OL,4,Alife-threatening stab wound
OL,5,
OL,6,FHoe was sentenced to six years and
OL,7,Feight months detention after he
OL,8,Fadmitted inflicting intentional
OL,9,Fgrievous bodily harm, while Flanigan
OL,10,Fwas jailed for having pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fwounding without intent.
